    },
    "comment" : {
      "en" : "A ripe:OverallIntegrityAssessmentQuestion is a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion representing the overall integrity question investigated for a ripe:Work within a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. It is answered by one or more ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances that synthesise the component integrity assessment questions and their corresponding hypotheses."
