    "label" : {
      "IRI-based" : "ResearchIntegrityAssessment",
      "en" : "Research integrity assessment"
    },
    "comment" : {
      "en" : "A ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment represents one integrity assessment of a work. It brings together the ripe:Work that is the subject of the assessment, the ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion instances investigated, the ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances answering those questions, the ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence instances supporting them, and the activities that generated or reviewed those outcomes. An assessment of a single published clinical trial report is one such instance."
    },
